  --manifest <path>            Operator manifest outside the target and artifact roots
  --environment <name>         Default-deny manifest environment, or the operator manifest's required one
  verify is read-only; install writes ai_agents_internal/authorization.json (mode 0600),
  keeps an identical manifest, and refuses to replace a different one

Authorization check boundaries:
  --source-trust <class>       manifest|user|untrusted (required)
  --account/--namespace/--mutation/--classification <value>
  --binary-reviewed <true|false> Confirm synthetic/masked + independently reviewed evidence
  --rate/--concurrency/--total-requests/--duration <positive-number>
  --resource <safe-label>      Optional label; audit output is always redacted
  --at <ISO-timestamp>         Deterministic evaluation time (tests only; refused in an engagement)

